   "design": "Almost nothing changes. The board books meetings on the teacher's calendar booking page instead of mailing back and forth, and the faculty's request form has a field for the adviser's support so a short note replaces a letter. Reading plans, advising, making contacts and attending events stay as they are.",
   "previous_blocker": "Nothing blocked it; the work is advice and relationships.",
   "enabler_now": "Calendar booking pages and faculty request forms.",
